## Hard Constraints

These are not preferences. A draft that breaks one gets revised before it ships.

1. No claim without a source. If it cannot be traced to a raw file, it does not go in.
2. No invented numbers, prices, dates or customer quotes. Ever. A missing number is reported as missing.
